### =====================================================================
### Durable Functions — parallel data fetching workflow.
### Requires Azurite running + the host on port 7219 (see README).
### =====================================================================

@base = http://localhost:7219/api

### 1) START the orchestration for a user. Returns 202 + an instanceId.
POST {{base}}/dashboard/user-777

### 2) POLL status until runtimeStatus = "Completed".
###    Paste the instanceId from step 1 in place of REPLACE_ID.
###    (Watch the host console: GetOrdersAsync fails twice, then the retry
###     policy recovers it on attempt 3 with exponential backoff.)
GET {{base}}/dashboard/status/REPLACE_ID
